===Etymology===
Southern dialectal form of {{m|it|umiltà||humility}}, from {{der|it|la|humilitātem}}, accusative of {{m|la|humilitās}}, from {{m|la|humilis||humble}}, from {{m|la|humus||ground, soil}}. See {{cog|scn|umirtà}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{wikipedia|lang=it}}
* {{IPA|/o.merˈta/|[omerˈt̪ä]|lang=it}}
* {{rhymes|a|lang=it}}
* {{hyphenation|o|mer|tà|lang=it}}

===Noun===
{{it-noun|f|-}}

# {{lb|it|crime}} {{l|en|An [[omertà]] or any [[code of silence]].}}
